<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-20T13:43:44.245Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:43:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Turkish forces remain in Syria and Iraq until border security is assured, while Damascus officials warn Druze factions, allegedly backed by Israel, may launch attacks in Sweida. DNA-based identification of the missing offers families hope, and a security vacuum has seen 38 civilians killed in 33 homicides since early October. The Syrian court continues trials of three defendants in transitional justice cases, and regional partners discussed recovery and food security at Doha and FAO meetings. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQNUJVaDRxZGZNQm56LXgyeWRYQS13c0lNcVp2S3dSVk1KWVlkYVhsMGlseWRTdTg3U1JQeDFHdEVRcElyYzQzS0FIQ0twelBXZk1DSkxlMWQ4OTBSZjI5VE1na2lLS0RKV0RTMTdEZWgxTktTX0JpZUxfZnZGaWhSVzVYX0pVYlc0Y1Y4UFdiNXFuTnJMeDFQSThTVVR3b2lOYzRoOXJON0NPQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WKZO&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE9NS1lLRTJJLU9CcmpGNnk4RlNaczVUXzdJSW00UURqWV9ybm1aNDJrVll2ZkQtRGZpX0R3eloxcGxMTFh2SGl0NDJNb3RWNjBmalR2SlZmbWlyOHJzcC16anp4X3hkQ2tsQWpVNXZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;CGTN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNaEVmb2wxMDFrclhZaDcya3JhcDBjZ1FJeVljTmJhQkltWFBfVjBSVS1JQk11TlVIcnUwSjFEYlRTUF8yZ294dW1rZHZ1X0J3MGJ5TXQ1SkhWdlJsUVBJYmRxcVlVbFE3bWZuZHJuR1Rrc1U3TFNTQzdUMWNHWFlNMHRSQ0tSRjFaTDhVS3lfVmJQZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE9fRXhYNTBJU1JiU090ZEFld2xFMFNkaEt1aHlaMVF6Z2NDRERoZlNCU3M0QmxhdkxqYkgweEcwdk85Zjl5Z0h3ZTlNWUdtNG1odnR1d3lB?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة صدى نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/ar